    {
      "id": "claim_15f93dc33a584df4a74771d18feadedd",
      "statement": "The sandbox delete operation only shell-quotes the target path to neutralize metacharacters and cannot restrict reach beyond what the sandbox shell can reach; whatever the sandbox shell can reach, delete can remove.",
