    {
      "id": "claim_2f0c9b26da374820a7830da50e3c945b",
      "statement": "The generated glob script bounds its walk over an untrusted tree with MAX_EXPANSIONS = 1000, MAX_MATCHES = 10000, and TIME_BUDGET = 5.0 seconds, and exceeding any bound sets a truncated warning on the result rather than failing so a partial result is never mistaken for an exhaustive one.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/deepagents/deepagents/backends/sandbox.py#L328-L367",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:83e1d8f766c9ec3d6cc238b01df5528795afc944298c0b9a24e1933813a72f99:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_143eb387fc6b4805aaffcfd9edb62afc",
      "statement": "Because the remote glob script's TIME_BUDGET covers only the walk and not interpreter startup, the round-trip, or record transfer, the async wrappers add an outer bound: aglob is bounded by ASYNC_GLOB_TIMEOUT = 30 seconds and agrep by ASYNC_GREP_TIMEOUT = (2 * DEFAULT_GREP_TIMEOUT) + 5 seconds, each returning a structured error on timeout instead of hanging the caller.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/deepagents/deepagents/backends/protocol.py#L20-L37",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:77a8b4e7cbcdc06b17189f0a8b63d6339897fa12c4552f73eda774249aa72b74:"
        },
