      "id": "claim_dd909a342093461794e12ec3f4910cca",
      "statement": "Each partner package under libs/partners/ is an independently versioned distribution that owns its own environment, pyproject.toml, Makefile, and tests, and wiring a new sandbox-backed partner requires additional CI, labeling, release, credential, and Harbor sandbox-option changes across the repository.",
