    {
      "id": "claim_3018343b9cdd4225a22c80b062cce851",
      "statement": "The runloop package adds a lifecycle provider, RunloopProvider, on top of the sandbox: get_or_create() creates or attaches a Runloop devbox (optionally booting from a named blueprint resolved in order RUNLOOP_SANDBOX_BLUEPRINT_ID, snapshot kwarg, RUNLOOP_SANDBOX_BLUEPRINT_NAME, then empty devbox) and returns a connected RunloopSandbox, translating a missing sandbox_id into a KeyError and creation failures into RuntimeError, while delete(sandbox_id=...) shuts a devbox down.",
      "evidence": [
